WEBVTT

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling, open up your eyes!

00:00:05.420 --> 00:00:08.220
Darling me wo akete

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
It is in this world's evil den

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:10.550
Kono yo no aku no soukutsu de

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
You shall receive a rare heart

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:15.470
Tsuibamareru kokoro hoshikute

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Escaping is impossible

00:00:15.470 --> 00:00:18.310
Nige mo dekinu

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
My imprisoned, pale-faced prince

00:00:18.310 --> 00:00:20.690
Yuuhei no souhaku no ouji yo

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
I am a goddess

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:25.650
Watashi ga megami

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Kami-chama Karin

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:28.150
Mini-Goddess Karin

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
In this ward, you have to poach everything

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.940
Subete wa mitsuryouku

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
With a hidden snare

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:33.320
Usumoreta wana ni

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
If you entrap them

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:35.030
Hamerareru no nara

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
You'll want to destroy them too…

00:00:35.030 --> 00:00:38.450
Konagona ni kudaite hoshii wa

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
To die from natural causes or imcompetence

00:00:38.450 --> 00:00:40.910
Shi ni itaranu yamai

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
It's all poison to your heart

00:00:40.910 --> 00:00:43.450
Shinzou ni ha pawazon

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
A rose melting in the flames of purgatory

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:46.120
Rengoku no homura de zero kara

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Let's redeem this world…

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:48.370
Saisei shimashou

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
A black dahlia in the nightless city's sky

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.420
Fuyoru no sora de kuroi daria

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
A lost delusion, a falling reality

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:56.210
Shisuru mousou ochiru genjitsu

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Struggling in hell like an ant

00:00:56.210 --> 00:00:59.090
Mogake ari jigoku

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling, give me your voice!

00:01:01.050 --> 00:01:03.800
Darling koe agete

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
For right now, our limits will have to change

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.100
Kono ima sashichigaeru hodo

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
If we want for the most important thing

00:01:06.100 --> 00:01:11.060
Daiji na mono ga hoshii no nara

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Discover the result of your prayers

00:01:11.060 --> 00:01:13.860
Inori wa hatete

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Your princess is dying in prison

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:16.230
Rougoku de shouten no himegimi

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
You are such a devil…

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:21.280
Anata ga maou

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Hate's fist and grief's wounds, too

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.780
Ikari no ken mo nageki no kizu mo

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Dissolving, vanishing, unraveling, passing away, without a trace

00:01:23.780 --> 00:01:29.960
Atokata mo naku tokete kiete chitte utakata

00:01:31.160 --> 00:01:35.110
Karin-chan transforms into a Mini-Goddess

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:41.160
I've been looking for you, goddess.

00:01:52.090 --> 00:01:52.970
That ring is…

00:01:54.490 --> 00:01:55.130
As I thought…

00:01:55.500 --> 00:01:57.480
What're you talking about?

00:01:57.480 --> 00:01:59.710
What about a goddess?

00:01:59.710 --> 00:02:01.780
You're all alone, aren't you?

00:02:01.780 --> 00:02:02.820
What?

00:02:03.300 --> 00:02:05.300
I've been investigating you.

00:02:06.310 --> 00:02:07.710
Your parents have died.

00:02:08.010 --> 00:02:11.060
Your best friend, the only one you opened your heart to, was your cat.

00:02:11.550 --> 00:02:15.110
And this is that best friend's grave.

00:02:17.720 --> 00:02:19.720
Who are you?!

00:02:19.720 --> 00:02:22.860
You're investigating me? Why?!

00:02:22.860 --> 00:02:26.200
For what reasons? My objectives?

00:02:28.050 --> 00:02:29.650
I want to get rid of that ring!

00:02:29.890 --> 00:02:30.330
What?

00:02:31.170 --> 00:02:33.170
Of course I wouldn't ask you to give it up for nothing.

00:02:33.370 --> 00:02:37.780
That's right. How about if I try resurrecting your pet for you?

00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:39.700
Shii-chan!

00:02:40.500 --> 00:02:42.740
Bringing Shii-chan back…

00:02:43.020 --> 00:02:44.780
Can you really do that?!

00:02:45.300 --> 00:02:49.230
Yeah, with the power of that ring, it's a piece of cake.

00:02:49.630 --> 00:02:52.260
After all, it's a ring of a goddess.

00:02:52.260 --> 00:02:54.630
What? Supernatural powers?

00:02:59.160 --> 00:03:00.680
Place your ring inside here!

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:05.360
Your ring will break and with that power, your best friend will be resurrected.

00:03:07.080 --> 00:03:08.810
Mom's ring…

00:03:16.810 --> 00:03:18.090
Come.

00:03:18.980 --> 00:03:21.700
I don't understand about this goddess stuff…

00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:26.060
…but… but if Shii-chan can come back then…

00:03:34.390 --> 00:03:37.270
I don't want to be alone anymore!

00:03:37.270 --> 00:03:39.760
Being all alone is…

00:03:39.760 --> 00:03:41.920
Idiot!

00:03:48.800 --> 00:03:51.290
Kazune-kun! Why?

00:03:51.890 --> 00:03:53.250
Are you alright?

00:03:53.490 --> 00:03:57.050
Geez… I came because I was worried…

00:03:57.050 --> 00:03:59.610
Trying to bring back a dead person…

00:03:59.610 --> 00:04:01.140
No way that can happen.

00:04:01.900 --> 00:04:04.100
Being a naive fool…

00:04:04.620 --> 00:04:07.740
Didn't you say this ring was precious to you?

00:04:08.540 --> 00:04:09.660
Was that a lie?!

00:04:10.260 --> 00:04:12.430
I almost tricked her too!

00:04:12.910 --> 00:04:16.190
Kujyou! You want this girl to be a goddess that badly?!

00:04:16.190 --> 00:04:19.030
I protected it because it's precious to her.

00:04:19.030 --> 00:04:20.990
Goddess or not, it doesn't matter.

00:04:22.640 --> 00:04:26.560
Really? Then show me what you're got!

00:04:26.560 --> 00:04:28.080
If you want to fight, bring it!

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:32.570
Where on earth did they pull those from?!

00:04:33.010 --> 00:04:35.970
Karin, it's dangerous! Girls should just hurry and escape.

00:04:37.570 --> 00:04:40.970
But Kazune-kun, you hurt your hand!

00:04:43.420 --> 00:04:46.500
At moments like these, it's a man's role to fight.

00:04:47.140 --> 00:04:48.300
Hurry and go!

00:04:48.860 --> 00:04:50.060
You're not getting away!

00:04:56.150 --> 00:04:57.790
I don't get it.

00:04:57.790 --> 00:04:59.590
What's going on?

00:05:00.670 --> 00:05:02.670
What's this about a goddess?

00:05:03.600 --> 00:05:06.920
I'm just a normal girl!

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:12.040
I'm worried about Kazune-kun.

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:14.170
I have to do something…

00:05:14.170 --> 00:05:16.650
But… what can I do?

00:05:16.650 --> 00:05:20.010
Ah Karin-chan, thank goodness.

00:05:20.210 --> 00:05:21.530
Himeka-chan!

00:05:21.530 --> 00:05:25.540
Kazune-chan had a scary look on his face when he left.

00:05:25.540 --> 00:05:27.540
So I was worried about you, Karin-chan.

00:05:27.540 --> 00:05:31.260
Do you know something about me, Himeka-chan?

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:33.140
Eh… that's…

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:34.830
Tell me! Himeka-chan!

00:05:34.830 --> 00:05:39.950
Well… more importantly, we need to get away from here.

00:05:41.230 --> 00:05:44.030
H-Himeka-chan! That's the road I came from!

00:05:48.120 --> 00:05:50.600
Why did you come back?!

00:05:50.600 --> 00:05:52.840
Oops… sorry.

00:05:53.200 --> 00:05:55.890
I can't look after you two when you're extra baggage!

00:05:55.890 --> 00:05:57.450
Damn you, Kujyou!

00:05:57.450 --> 00:06:00.290
Getting reinforcements! That's low!

00:06:00.530 --> 00:06:01.810
Now that's it come to this…

00:06:02.570 --> 00:06:05.540
Police!

00:06:11.340 --> 00:06:12.820
It'll get complicated if someone comes…

00:06:14.340 --> 00:06:17.790
Kujyou! We're not finished!

00:06:19.670 --> 00:06:21.670
We're saved!

00:06:21.910 --> 00:06:23.950
Doing reckless stuff like that…

00:06:25.950 --> 00:06:30.760
Hey Kazune-kun, who was that person?

00:06:30.760 --> 00:06:32.480
What's this about goddesses?

00:06:34.920 --> 00:06:37.170
Kazune-kun you know, right?

00:06:37.170 --> 00:06:40.130
About the ring… and the goddesses.

00:06:40.770 --> 00:06:43.690
Please! Tell me!

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:49.580
Yeah. I have no choice but to tell you now…

00:06:50.540 --> 00:06:54.580
We'll meet tomorrow. I'll explain everything then.

00:06:54.580 --> 00:06:56.260
Yeah, I understand.

00:06:58.870 --> 00:07:03.710
Sorry Karin. You're gotten involved in this.

00:07:11.840 --> 00:07:14.440
Back to normal, huh?..

00:07:23.970 --> 00:07:26.650
Yesterday seems like a dream…

00:07:31.100 --> 00:07:34.540
It all feels normal now…

00:07:34.540 --> 00:07:37.300
Look, look! Isn't he cool?

00:07:37.300 --> 00:07:39.710
I wonder who's he waiting for?..

00:07:42.000 --> 00:07:42.910
Hi.

00:07:43.030 --> 00:07:46.470
Kazune-kun! And Himeka-chan!

00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:54.680
I have so much I want to ask…

00:07:54.680 --> 00:07:58.040
I don't know where to begin…

00:07:58.040 --> 00:07:59.930
How should I start the conversation…

00:08:00.450 --> 00:08:05.650
Ah, Kazune-kun is really cool… those girls were fussing over him.

00:08:06.210 --> 00:08:10.500
A-Ah… now that I'm thinking about it, I'm getting more distracted!

00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:12.540
How to start…

00:08:12.540 --> 00:08:13.700
They're blooming.

00:08:14.860 --> 00:08:15.380
The plum blossoms.

00:08:15.740 --> 00:08:19.980
Ah, yeah. It's going to be spring soon.

00:08:19.980 --> 00:08:23.230
I'm looking forward to junior high.

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:26.430
I hate it… Spring.

00:08:26.630 --> 00:08:31.440
I see. Kazune-kun is going to be in junior high in the spring too, right?

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:33.720
Which school are you going to?

00:08:33.720 --> 00:08:35.400
Sakuragaoka.

00:08:35.400 --> 00:08:38.480
You mean that famous Seiei Sakuragaoka?

00:08:38.480 --> 00:08:39.520
Yeah.

00:08:39.520 --> 00:08:42.210
You must be really smart.

00:08:42.850 --> 00:08:46.330
Kazune-kun, what're you worrying about? Need the toilet?

00:08:46.330 --> 00:08:49.930
You moron! That's not it! I just…

00:08:50.890 --> 00:08:52.940
Karin-chan!

00:08:53.420 --> 00:08:54.500
Himeka-chan!

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:55.620
Hey! Are you alright?

00:08:58.700 --> 00:09:04.030
I saw some of the best plum blossoms blooming, so I picked them for you, Karin-chan…

00:09:04.030 --> 00:09:05.830
But, they got crushed.

00:09:06.550 --> 00:09:07.670
You picked those?

00:09:08.030 --> 00:09:11.270
Thanks Himeka-chan! I'm really happy!

00:09:12.310 --> 00:09:13.440
That's great.

00:09:13.440 --> 00:09:17.280
But what makes those the best ones?

00:09:17.280 --> 00:09:20.320
Um… look at the very end.

00:09:20.320 --> 00:09:22.680
Look, a caterpillar.

00:09:24.450 --> 00:09:26.290
Are you okay, Kazune-kun?

00:09:26.290 --> 00:09:29.690
Not to the point where a girl should worry about me!

00:09:30.410 --> 00:09:34.140
When spring arrives, the bugs come out, right?

00:09:34.140 --> 00:09:36.220
That's why I love spring.

00:09:36.220 --> 00:09:41.060
Himeka-chan, is that spring you like… or is it the bugs?

00:09:41.060 --> 00:09:43.580
Don't bring that bug near me, no matter what!

00:09:43.580 --> 00:09:46.190
- Why don't you like bugs?

00:09:43.860 --> 00:09:46.190
- And he hates bugs…

00:09:47.190 --> 00:09:49.550
Stop chasing me with that bug!

00:09:52.430 --> 00:09:54.600
What is it, Karin-chan?

00:09:56.400 --> 00:09:59.560
I was just thinking that this kind of friendship is nice.

00:09:59.560 --> 00:10:00.520
It looks fun.

00:10:22.980 --> 00:10:26.510
This is where we're staying.

00:10:26.950 --> 00:10:28.350
It makes my eyes dizzy…

00:10:28.870 --> 00:10:36.030
We were supposed to return yesterday, but Kazune-chan said he had to speak to you.

00:10:36.720 --> 00:10:40.520
This fancy hotel and that famous school…

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:46.400
It's like our worlds are completely different…

00:10:49.010 --> 00:10:49.850
Hey, Karin.

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:51.290
Y-Yes?

00:10:51.770 --> 00:10:54.610
What do you think a God is?

00:10:55.330 --> 00:10:56.410
A great person?

00:10:56.410 --> 00:10:57.740
Zero points.

00:10:59.500 --> 00:11:03.540
It depends on your race and religion but it's someone with power.

00:11:03.540 --> 00:11:06.460
Someone who's merciful and absolute.

00:11:06.460 --> 00:11:10.350
Someone who rules. Someone who protects.

00:11:10.830 --> 00:11:11.750
Protects…

00:11:13.470 --> 00:11:17.920
Karin, when you connected with the ring, you borrowed the powers of a goddess.

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:21.240
I borrowed the powers of a goddess?

00:11:21.720 --> 00:11:23.160
For what purpose?

00:11:23.800 --> 00:11:26.280
Well for us, our purpose is to protect.

00:11:26.280 --> 00:11:29.610
Then… what about the incident at school?

00:11:29.610 --> 00:11:34.610
Because it was your first time using the ring, your powers probably got out of control a little.

00:11:34.930 --> 00:11:37.010
The power of a goddess…

00:11:37.930 --> 00:11:40.220
The power to protect…

00:11:52.430 --> 00:11:53.590
A crow…

00:11:54.510 --> 00:11:57.110
Kazune-chan! A crow!

00:11:57.110 --> 00:12:00.560
Sorry Himeka, we're discussing important matters here.

00:12:00.560 --> 00:12:01.280
Okay.

00:12:06.360 --> 00:12:11.130
Karin do you remember the person yesterday who tried to get rid of your ring?

00:12:11.130 --> 00:12:13.290
That glasses guy?

00:12:13.290 --> 00:12:16.690
That glasses guy… he's our enemy.

00:12:17.130 --> 00:12:19.690
He's here to erase your power.

00:12:19.970 --> 00:12:20.580
Enemy?

00:12:22.860 --> 00:12:24.740
What's this?

00:12:25.820 --> 00:12:27.380
Thanks.

00:12:27.380 --> 00:12:28.980
A letter is it?

00:12:31.270 --> 00:12:35.270
That pisses me off! I haven't done anything and he's my enemy?!

00:12:35.270 --> 00:12:38.230
I'll beat him with my goddess powers!

00:12:38.230 --> 00:12:40.270
Shut up, and quiet down!

00:12:41.560 --> 00:12:43.680
You moron. Where are you looking now?

00:12:43.680 --> 00:12:45.280
Himeka-chan's gone…

00:12:45.280 --> 00:12:45.880
Eh?

00:12:53.730 --> 00:12:54.720
Is it grilled
eel over rice?

00:12:55.800 --> 00:12:58.260
I am God!

00:13:01.970 --> 00:13:03.220
You moron.

00:13:02.150 --> 00:13:03.170
It's a croquette!

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:30.520
Kazune-chan! A crow!

00:13:31.400 --> 00:13:34.450
Sorry Himeka, we're discussing important matters…

00:13:35.450 --> 00:13:38.090
He had crows…

00:13:39.970 --> 00:13:41.370
I'm going to look for her!

00:13:41.370 --> 00:13:42.930
I'll come too!

00:13:54.710 --> 00:13:56.270
Himeka!

00:13:56.310 --> 00:13:58.670
Himeka-chan!

00:13:59.710 --> 00:14:01.190
Not here… damn…

00:14:01.870 --> 00:14:06.720
Geez… girls this, girls that, you're pretty lost yourself.

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:08.000
Shut up.

00:14:08.400 --> 00:14:11.480
If he enemy catches Himeka-chan, things will be bad right?

00:14:11.560 --> 00:14:12.200
Yeah.

00:14:12.560 --> 00:14:15.050
Anyways we need to hurry…

00:14:15.050 --> 00:14:17.130
I've been found already!?

00:14:17.410 --> 00:14:19.450
Since I've been found, I guess there's no choice.

00:14:21.490 --> 00:14:23.290
Ah! Glasses guy!

00:14:23.290 --> 00:14:25.340
I'm not "glasses guy"!

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:26.780
So that's where you were!

00:14:28.020 --> 00:14:30.700
I planned to only lure Himeka, why are you…

00:14:30.700 --> 00:14:33.020
Hey impatient glasses guy, where's Himeka-chan?

00:14:33.500 --> 00:14:36.830
My name isn't "impatient glasses guy", it's Karasuma Kirio.

00:14:36.870 --> 00:14:38.870
Where's Himeka-chan?

00:14:38.870 --> 00:14:43.790
If you don't tell us, I'll show you divine punishment!

00:14:44.470 --> 00:14:46.240
Girls are so…

00:14:46.240 --> 00:14:49.960
How do I make the ring shine…

00:14:50.480 --> 00:14:54.280
Were you listening to what I was saying earlier?!

00:14:54.280 --> 00:14:58.450
How am I supposed to understand a story like that?!

00:15:00.130 --> 00:15:02.050
This is why girls are so…

00:15:06.330 --> 00:15:08.660
If that hits you, it'll drain your power!

00:15:08.660 --> 00:15:09.700
Be careful!

00:15:10.940 --> 00:15:13.340
I want to use my goddess powers already!

00:15:13.340 --> 00:15:15.100
How do I use it?! Hey!

00:15:15.100 --> 00:15:16.940
For now, focus your prayers on protecting something.

00:15:16.940 --> 00:15:19.160
Then the goddess' power will come!

00:15:19.160 --> 00:15:22.790
The will to protect? Protect what? Hey!

00:15:22.830 --> 00:15:26.030
Karin-chan! Butterflies!

00:15:26.710 --> 00:15:27.520
Don't come near me!

00:15:27.710 --> 00:15:29.520
Himeka! You're late!

00:15:32.600 --> 00:15:34.480
Bugs!

00:15:35.040 --> 00:15:36.040
Kazune-kun!

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:39.210
Sorry Kazune-chan…

00:15:39.770 --> 00:15:41.370
What's with these butterflies?

00:15:41.730 --> 00:15:45.370
It was in the letter the crow gave me.

00:15:45.370 --> 00:15:46.930
Here, look.

00:15:46.270 --> 00:15:47.730
<u>Letter:</u> There's some cute bugs here.

00:15:48.010 --> 00:15:53.260
I got lost following the map, but I found lots of butterflies.

00:15:53.260 --> 00:15:54.460
You got lost?

00:15:55.020 --> 00:15:57.860
The powers of some amateur goddess will be nothing.

00:15:57.860 --> 00:16:00.910
I'll drain all three of your powers!

00:16:01.990 --> 00:16:05.870
Oh no! Himeka-chan, don't get hit by that!

00:16:06.190 --> 00:16:08.110
I'll start with you first!

00:16:08.590 --> 00:16:10.600
Karin-chan!

00:16:14.960 --> 00:16:16.680
Himeka-chan!

00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:19.850
Himeka-chan! Himeka-chan!

00:16:20.210 --> 00:16:22.290
Himeka-chan! Are you alright?

00:16:24.970 --> 00:16:27.730
What do I do… what do I… ?

00:16:33.820 --> 00:16:36.180
I can't do anything!

00:16:36.180 --> 00:16:39.460
Without Shii-chan, I'm a weakling that can't do anything!

00:16:41.790 --> 00:16:43.750
I don't want that!

00:16:47.830 --> 00:16:50.070
I have to do something.

00:16:54.160 --> 00:16:56.120
I have to protect them!

00:16:57.360 --> 00:16:58.360
Kazune-kun…

00:17:00.640 --> 00:17:01.970
Himeka-chan!

00:17:04.090 --> 00:17:07.810
Goddess, lend me your power! Goddess!

00:18:14.720 --> 00:18:15.920
Karin…

00:18:16.760 --> 00:18:19.080
Karin-chan…

00:18:28.050 --> 00:18:29.650
Back to a goddess, huh?

00:18:36.380 --> 00:18:39.260
Wow! This is my power?

00:18:39.700 --> 00:18:41.780
But you still can't do anything yet!

00:18:41.780 --> 00:18:43.940
I'll take Himeka's powers!

00:18:44.340 --> 00:18:45.870
Stop it!

00:18:55.110 --> 00:18:58.200
They can't see my powers?

00:18:59.920 --> 00:19:00.910
What should I do?

00:19:00.910 --> 00:19:03.010
I can't control it!

00:19:03.010 --> 00:19:04.200
It's going wild!

00:19:08.530 --> 00:19:11.130
No! What should I do?

00:19:11.130 --> 00:19:13.010
Stop it! Stop!

00:19:16.290 --> 00:19:17.980
Karin! Calm yourself.

00:19:17.980 --> 00:19:19.500
Kazune-kun.

00:19:19.500 --> 00:19:21.540
I won't let him lay a single finger on Himeka.

00:19:26.660 --> 00:19:29.670
Listen up, Karin. I'll take care of aiming.

00:19:29.670 --> 00:19:33.030
You'll focus your power. Imagine light.

00:19:33.030 --> 00:19:34.030
But…

00:19:34.030 --> 00:19:35.830
It'll be okay. I'm with you.

00:19:36.790 --> 00:19:38.280
You're not alone.

00:19:38.960 --> 00:19:40.720
I'm not alone…

00:19:48.690 --> 00:19:49.930
I understand.

00:19:49.930 --> 00:19:52.410
Light, the light right?

00:19:57.010 --> 00:19:58.050
Alright, now!

00:19:58.050 --> 00:20:01.560
Finishing Move! God Thunder!

00:20:01.560 --> 00:20:03.180
What kind of name is that?!

00:20:03.580 --> 00:20:05.140
Go!

00:20:08.940 --> 00:20:10.310
Impossible.

00:20:22.400 --> 00:20:23.280
We did it!

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:24.320
Thank goodness.

00:20:24.960 --> 00:20:25.720
Karin.

00:20:26.240 --> 00:20:28.040
Kazune-kun.

00:20:30.570 --> 00:20:32.050
You did well.

00:20:43.140 --> 00:20:44.660
Are you alright now?

00:20:44.660 --> 00:20:46.220
Yeah, I'm alright now.

00:20:48.060 --> 00:20:51.030
The feelings behind the will to protect someone are strong, aren't they?

00:20:51.270 --> 00:20:54.390
To think that I'm able to use the powers of a goddess…

00:20:54.830 --> 00:20:59.070
Well, you'll soon understand what it really means to be strong.

00:21:02.200 --> 00:21:03.960
Thanks, Kazune-kun.

00:21:05.240 --> 00:21:10.800
I wasn't really alone, the truth is that many were watching over me.

00:21:13.410 --> 00:21:18.490
I always relied on Shii-chan alone so I never noticed.

00:21:19.370 --> 00:21:22.060
But thanks to Kazune-kun, I realized.

00:21:22.060 --> 00:21:23.420
I'm really thankful.

00:21:26.500 --> 00:21:28.700
I'll be fine even if I'm alone now.

00:21:28.900 --> 00:21:31.900
Since there's a goddess inside of me now.

00:21:31.900 --> 00:21:34.670
You still have quite a way to go.

00:21:34.670 --> 00:21:37.790
It's not a goddess yet but a mini-goddess.

00:21:38.310 --> 00:21:40.150
A mini-goddess, huh?

00:21:41.150 --> 00:21:44.720
But Karin-chan, you're not alone anymore.

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:45.320
Huh?

00:21:45.320 --> 00:21:49.280
We'll be going to the same school starting in the spring.

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:51.560
Eh? What do you mean?

00:21:52.400 --> 00:21:54.730
People will be after your ring.

00:21:54.970 --> 00:21:57.530
We can't just leave you here alone.

00:21:57.890 --> 00:22:02.170
Karin-chan will be living in the same city as us.

00:22:02.170 --> 00:22:03.820
R-Really?

00:22:03.820 --> 00:22:06.700
Kazune-chan hasn't told you yet?

00:22:07.380 --> 00:22:08.620
I was busy…

00:22:11.020 --> 00:22:13.980
Shii-chan, can you hear me?

00:22:14.310 --> 00:22:17.590
I've been really sad that you're gone.

00:22:18.430 --> 00:22:22.510
But I'll be fine now. I'm not alone anymore.

00:22:23.190 --> 00:22:27.440
Keep watching over me okay, Shii-chan?

00:22:28.280 --> 00:22:32.320
I wonder what kind of lifestyle is waiting for me in the spring?

00:22:50.030 --> 00:22:55.500
Totsuzen no sutorii hajimaru yo

00:22:50.030 --> 00:22:55.500
The story has suddenly begun…

00:22:55.500 --> 00:23:03.860
Ring hikari dasu

00:22:55.500 --> 00:23:03.860
…with the ring shining.

00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:09.280
Ate no nai tabiji wo kimi to

00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:09.280
I'm on an aimless journey with you,

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:15.750
Saa, hashire

00:23:09.280 --> 00:23:15.750
Come, let's run.

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:31.180
Ima ruriiro somatta kono omoi wo

00:23:17.250 --> 00:23:31.180
Right now, these azure feelings that have built up…

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:34.640
Yume mite koi shite

00:23:31.180 --> 00:23:34.640
…that I've been dreaming of, and love…

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:45.030
Sora made ukande hakanai anemone

00:23:34.640 --> 00:23:45.030
…are floating up into the sky, like a never wilting anemone.

00:23:45.030 --> 00:23:52.080
Todoku koto no nai tegami hoshi no you ni

00:23:45.030 --> 00:23:52.080
This letter that cannot be delivered, will become like a star…

00:23:52.080 --> 00:24:01.880
So yo kaze sayonara aa…

00:23:52.080 --> 00:24:01.880
Yes, it will have have to bid the wind farewell.

00:24:05.320 --> 00:24:10.280
Himeka-chan's Secret

00:24:06.290 --> 00:24:08.210
Next time on Kami-chama Karin:

00:24:08.210 --> 00:24:10.780
Himeka-chan's Secret!

00:24:10.780 --> 00:24:15.940
Wow! A big secret about Himeka-chan gets revealed!

00:24:16.540 --> 00:24:18.700
I can't say anymore than that…
